  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - Barat Timur Indonesia Subsea Cable System Feasibility Study, through APTelecom</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A USTDA grant for Indonesian company PT Super Sistem Data (SSD) is funding a feasibility study to support the development of the Barat Timur Indonesia subsea fiber optic cable system (BTI Cable System) that will add critical domestic backbone capacity in Indonesia. The study will assess the technical and commercial viability of the cable system, prepare the data and analysis required for financing, and provide detailed plans to guide implementation of the project.</narrative>
  </description>
